MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_001: Huh. What a mess.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_002: Thanks for tagging along, Luminous One. Today's\ngoing to be good. I can just feel it.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_003: My gut's telling me we'll find something buried\nright over...here!
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_004: Look! Under all of this!
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_005: Give me a hand. We can make quick work of this\nstuff. Hup!
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_006: A-ha! My gut never lies. Now let's see...
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_007: It's a flower brooch. Hmm...there's a whole petal\nmissing. Color's faded too. Oh well.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_008: It was supposed to be prettier. So much for my gut.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_009: <NCA>"Were you looking for an accessory?"
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_010: <NCB>"I'm sorry you didn't have better luck."
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_011: <ACA>Yeah. I was hoping to find something sparkly—the\nkind of thing you can only buy in a big city.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_012: <ACB>Eh, it's OK. I just wanted to find something\nsparkly, I guess.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_013: Where I grew up, people didn't aspire to be much of\nanything. I moved to Dagsion for a brighter life.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_014: I loved putting my fighting skill to better use as a\ngladiator—and exploring the city between matches!
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_015: Now all of that seems so long ago, when the world\nwas different.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_016: That whole life I made for myself...gone.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_017: I remember this market being full of life and light,\nexcitement everywhere. Now it's...abandoned.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_018: <NCA>"It'll be restored."
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_019: You think so? It's so different from what it used\nto be. That won't be easy.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_020: <NCA>"Would you let me borrow that brooch?"
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_021: Um, OK. What do you want with it anyway? It's just\na piece of junk now.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_022: Ngh...
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_023: How— The missing petal! How'd you do that?
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_024: Thank you. Huh, I never knew you were so crafty.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_025: Hehe. Maybe this place isn't quite as hopeless\nas I thought.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_A_026: One day, we'll put it back together and restore all its\nshine, but first we have to win this war.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_001: Heh. Welcome back, Luminous One. I had a feeling\nI'd see you here today.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_002: <NCA>"How did you know?"
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_003: I don't know. I just did. Following my gut.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_004: It's let me down in the past, but today it was right\non the money.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_005: I wanted to give you something. See? It's that\nflower brooch you fixed up for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_006: <NCA>"What a lovely thought."
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_007: <NCB>"Did you repaint this?"
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_008: <ACA>It cleaned up pretty good, didn't it? I found a\ncraftsman to repaint it for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_009: <ACB>Yeah. I found a really talented craftsman who did\nthe job for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_010: I said it was important to paint it up really nice\nand make sure it lasted a long time.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_011: Point is, no matter how rough your journey gets,\nthat brooch is going to make it through.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_012: <NCA>"You knew I was going on a journey too?"
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_013: <NCB>"What are you talking about?"
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_014: <ACA>Your work's not finished, is it? You've got more\npeople to save.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_015: <ACB>C'mon, don't play dumb. There's more for you to do,\nmore people to save out there.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_016: I didn't need my gut to tell me that. When you're\nfriends with someone long enough, you just know.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_017: Anyway, I don't think I'll be going with you this time.\nI belong here, in Dagsion.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_018: This city is my home. It's my favorite place in the\nworld, and I want to be here to rebuild it.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_019: So, I guess this is goodbye. I want you to think of this\nbrooch as a parting gift.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_020: <NCA>"I will treasure this always."
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_021: Glad to hear it. I hope it reminds you of me. Not that\nI consider myself a fragile flower, of course.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_022: <RSDS>I'm going to fix my city just like you fixed this little\nflower brooch.
MID_SE_Ism_Noc_S_023: You'll see for yourself, next time we meet. I can't\nwait to see the look on your face!